# Add project specific R8 rules here.
# AGP will combine all keep rule files in src/main/keepRules to pass to R8
#
# For more details, see
#   https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules
#
# PdfBox-Android ships its own consumer rules (reflective SecurityHandler constructors,
# documentinterchange). Its resources load through absolute asset paths, so no
# package-wide keep is needed.

# PdfBox-Android's JPXFilter references the optional JPEG 2000 decoder
# (com.gemalto.jp2:jp2-android), which is not a dependency; JPX images fail gracefully.
-dontwarn com.gemalto.jp2.**

# ML Kit: MlKitInitProvider instantiates the ComponentRegistrar classes named in the merged
# manifest <meta-data> reflectively via their no-arg constructor. firebase-components'
# consumer rule keeps the classes but not <init>(), which R8 full mode then removes
# (NoSuchMethodException -> TextRegistrar never registers -> OCR returns no text).
-keep class * implements com.google.firebase.components.ComponentRegistrar {
    <init>();
}
